                                                "sense_id": "454f8fba-4cdc-3dc9-8779-36096c22ab2e",
                                                "text": "I knew I done the right thing and I'd do it all over again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e6a76c9-0533-4659-bad1-1e9f6ad37f01",
                                                "sense_id": "454f8fba-4cdc-3dc9-8779-36096c22ab2e",
                                                "text": "Be Still... and Know That I Am God: Devotions for Every Day of the Year\nShe opened it up to find a quarter and a note scrawled in childish letters that said, \"I done it for love.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa4c638e-c060-3baa-9251-d1ae039779f1",
                                        "entry_id": "e5c59cf5-cf5e-3be9-8575-e79b2bb9c9a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used in forming the perfective aspect; have."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Cockney",
